      by: #735
  [added] Source of Verifier Metadata
    + (MAY) Wallets MAY use other ecosystem-specific trusted sources of Verifier metadata, provided the Wallet is able to establish trust in those sources.
      by: #735
  [added] Parsing of untrusted inputs
    + (MUST) Wallets MUST treat all incoming requests as untrusted input.
      by: #759
  [added] Parsing of untrusted inputs
